## 2. 环境约定

### 2.1 探测规则

| 项 | 默认值 | 覆盖方式 |
|---|---|---|
| `DSH_HOME` | `C:\Users\<user>\.dsh` | config.json `dshHome` |
| `profile` | `desktop` | config.json `profile`；`DSH_PROFILE` 仅用于 doctor 校验 |
| `profileDir` | `$DSH_HOME/profiles/$profile` | config.json `profileDir` |
| 启动方式 | `electron-exe` | config.json `launchMode` |
| 启动命令 | `DeepSeek Harness.exe` 绝对路径 | config.json `launch`（数组） |
| 期望版本 | `0.2.1-rc.2` | config.json `expectedClientVersion` |
| 端口 | 动态 | `portMode`（`dynamic`/`fixed`） |
| 启动超时 | `90000` ms | `startTimeoutMs` |
| 稳定观察 | `15000` ms | `settleMs` |
| 探测轮超时 | `45000` / `8000` ms | `probeStartTimeoutMs` / `probeSettleMs` |
| bisect 总预算 | `300000` ms | `maxBisectMs` |
| 单实例策略 | `kill-first` | `singleInstance` |
| 锁超时 | `600000` ms | `lockTimeoutMs` |
| 跟踪文件 | 5 个 | `trackedFiles` |
| 源码路径 | 2 个 | `trackedSourcePaths` + `sourceInclude` |
| 快照上限 | `20` MB | `maxSnapshotMB` |
| 镜像删除域 | `["trackedFiles"]` | `mirrorDelete` |
| LKG 保留 | `3` | `keepLkg` |

### 2.2 config.json 模板（本机实测值）

```json
{
  "dshHome": "C:\\Users\\28256\\.dsh",
  "profile": "desktop",
  "profileDir": "C:\\Users\\28256\\.dsh\\profiles\\desktop",
  "launchMode": "electron-exe",
  "launch": ["C:\\Users\\28256\\AppData\\Local\\Programs\\DeepSeek Harness\\DeepSeek Harness.exe"],
  "expectedClientVersion": "0.2.1-rc.2",
  "portMode": "dynamic",
  "port": 0,
  "startTimeoutMs": 90000,
  "settleMs": 15000,
  "probeStartTimeoutMs": 45000,
  "probeSettleMs": 8000,
  "maxBisectMs": 300000,
  "singleInstance": "kill-first",
  "killGraceMs": 5000,
  "lockTimeoutMs": 600000,
  "preflight": ["patchParses", "bundlesResolvable", "patchTargetsResolvable", "depsResolvable", "lockfileMatches"],
  "trackedFiles": ["cordis.patch.yml", "package.json", "cordis.yml", "pnpm-workspace.yaml", "pnpm-lock.yaml"],
